  "summary": "The identified studies apply federated learning, described as 'decentralised training without pooled records', to the task of early prediction of septic deterioration. Fischer et al. (2023) [V0012] and Duarte et al. (2021) [V0010] report on this method using the CellLife and AgriSat-4 datasets respectively. El-Sayed et al. (2022) [V0011] evaluates the approach on LedgerGuard, while Chen et al. (2020) [V0009] utilizes Atlas-ICU. Additionally, Duarte et al. (2021) [V0004] applies a different method, 'message passing over relational graphs', to the same sepsis prediction task on CellLife.",
